#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:59
#: 81958ab7c2974d15bf1e0bd8db461d73
msgid ""
"When using with ``sim_vehicle.py``, ensure that the ``-A`` option is used to"
" pass the configuration option to the SITL executable. For example:"
msgstr ""
"与 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 配合使用时，请确保使用 ``-A`` 选项将配置参数传递给 SITL (软件在环仿真) 可执行文件。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:66
#: b275f8f64ee1409592e750a73973302f
msgid ""
"If you are writing your own sketch using the ArduPilot HAL then you can use "
"these UARTs for any purpose you like, but if possible you should try to use "
"the above assignments as it will allow you to fit in more easily to existing"
" code."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用 ArduPilot HAL 编写自己的代码，可以将这些 UART "
"用于任何目的，但如果可能的话，应尽量使用上述分配方式，以便更容易与现有代码集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:71
#: e9f8c4fff8b54596af214e28917cd318
msgid ""
"You can change the role of UART by changing its SERIALn_PROTOCOL param. "
"Possible parameter values are listed in the description for "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过更改 SERIALn_PROTOCOL 参数来改变 UART 的角色。可用的参数值在 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 的描述中列出。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:73
#: 3df602a3a8d5483b80fc8f161ceaea3d
msgid ""
"Go and have a look at the `libraries/AP_HAL/examples/UART_test "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/examples/UART_test/UART_test.cpp>`__"
" example sketch. It prints a hello message to the 1st 5 UARTs. Try it on "
"your board and see if you can get all the outputs displaying using a USB "
"serial adapter. Try changing the baudrate in the sketch."
msgstr ""
"去看看 `libraries/AP_HAL/examples/UART_test "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/examples/UART_test/UART_test.cpp>`__"
" 示例程序。它向前 5 个 UART 打印一条 hello 消息。在你的板子上试试，用 USB "
"串口适配器看能否让所有输出都显示出来，再试着改改程序里的波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:79
#: a97b1c1275114031856b4c4d343de325
msgid "Debug console"
msgstr "调试控制台"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:81
#: 897bc014ebea4b819de4ed0d772ddae1
msgid ""
"Historically, In addition to the basic 5 UARTs there was an additional debug"
" console available on some platforms. Recently debug console is directed to "
"USB. On SITL, debug is directed to a terminal, while USB is directed to port"
" 5760 by default."
msgstr ""
"历史上，除了基本的 5 个 UART 之外，某些平台还提供了额外的调试控制台。最近调试控制台已改为输出到 USB。在 SITL (软件在环仿真) "
"中，调试输出到终端，而 USB 默认输出到端口 5760。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:85
#: 81ac36017e9349e0bbaa9d66c9066c19
msgid ""
"If you have a board that does have HAL_OS_POSIX_IO set (check that in "
"`AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__)"
" then try adding some :code:`::printf()` and other stdio functions to the "
"UART_test sketch."
msgstr ""
"如果你的板子设置了 HAL_OS_POSIX_IO（在 `AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__"
" 中确认），可以试着往 UART_test 程序里加一些 :code:`::printf()` 及其他 stdio 函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:91
#: e9a0a949e89d4eb19e846c5f56fa52f4
msgid ""
"If :code:`::printf` doesn't work for you, it may be that your particular "
"file (e.g. a library) does not have :code:`#include <stdio.h>` at the top of"
" it, just add it. :-)"
msgstr ""
"如果 :code:`::printf` 不起作用，可能是你的文件（例如某个库）顶部没有 :code:`#include "
"<stdio.h>`，添加它即可。:-)"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:93
#: 404a3df9dfa345199b51b1eb9a8e0e4e
msgid "You can also use hal.console->printf() to specify USB port."
msgstr "也可以使用 hal.console->printf() 来指定 USB 端口输出。"

